    "description": "This repository contains datasets and source code used and described in the associated publication 'From outcrop to spectrum'. Data_Set_S1 contains 67700 raw Raman spectra of all measured positions in sample slide KL_L2. This sample slide contains the 30 \u2013 62 \u00b5m fraction of samples EY60_1 to EY60_6 and KL18_1 to KL18_7. Data_Set_S2 contains 56320 raw Raman spectra of all measured positions in sample slide KL_L4. This sample slide contains the 10 \u2013 30 \u00b5m fraction of samples EY60_1 to EY60_6 and KL18_1 to KL18_7.",
